\newlabel{fig:teaser}{{1}{1}{Measurements against safety at the largest static/kinetic ratio in the training range. The unshielded residual (B2) needs the fewest measurements but still overshoots. The shield-trained residual (B5) keeps overshoot near zero at about the model controller's measurement cost. The shielded model controller (B0S) pays far more measurements for the same safety. Bars: 95\% Clopper--Pearson intervals}{figure.caption.1}{}}
